NOT FOR MERGE. Committed only so 420 lines of uncommitted staged work stop
living in a prunable worktree — this branch is deliberately NOT integrated.

`erp-httponly-cookie-session-2026-07` Slice 2 ("ERP backend — mount the seed
auth router") is marked NEVER DISPATCHED; this is a partial attempt at it that
was left staged. It must not land as-is:

  · Slice 1b′ (the `createProductLayout` cookie-mode seam) is still IN PROGRESS
    on `feat/seed-layout-session-seam`, and Slice 3 is BLOCKED on it.
  · The roadmap explicitly flags Slice 2 as colliding with the
    org-source-of-truth fan-out in `products/erp-imobiliario/backend/`.
  · SEC-6 (the MINTED ACCESS TOKEN, not the session id, must reach
    `set_session`) is a security property this partial work has not been
    verified against.
  · `migrations/040_api_tokens.sql` now COLLIDES — erp is at 042. It needs
    renumbering to 043 before it could ever apply.

Resuming means re-dispatching Slice 2 properly against current `dev`, not
cherry-picking this. Recorded in the roadmap's Slice-2 row.

